    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[It's something you've requested for many years. You've got married and changed your name, or you play for multiple teams, and on this website that means you have two separate sets of statistics. Now for the first time you can combine them into one set of all your statistics.]]></Value>
    </description>
